{"id":"60ee7e3001f35785","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-controlset.md","title":"Control sets for Boolean zero equations","display":"df-controlset — Control sets for Boolean zero equations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-controlset","aliases":["27-df-controlset"],"display":"df-controlset — Control sets for Boolean zero equations","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.5.1","source_printed_pages":"83","source_pdf_pages":"107","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-controlset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-controlset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-controlset — Control sets for Boolean zero equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"83"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"107"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^{[n]}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^{[n]}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq[n]\">\\(J\\subseteq[n]\\)</span> 给定一个函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_J\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^{J}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_J\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^{J}}\\)</span>，作为可直接处理的剩余问题类；集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>。对不交定义域的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\cup b\">\\(a\\cup b\\)</span> 是其并。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 是下节定义的二元谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_{S\\gets b}\\coloneqq\\bigl(a\\mapsto f(a\\cup b)\\bigr)\\qquad(b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{S},\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{[n]\\setminus S}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_{S\\gets b}\\coloneqq\\bigl(a\\mapsto f(a\\cup b)\\bigr)\\qquad(b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{S},\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{[n]\\setminus S}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}(S,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{S}\\;f_{S\\gets b}\\in\\mathcal C_{[n]\\setminus S}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}(S,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{S}\\;f_{S\\gets b}\\in\\mathcal C_{[n]\\setminus S}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\left(\\{|S|\\mid S\\subseteq[n]\\land\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}(S,f)\\}\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\kappa_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\left(\\{|S|\\mid S\\subseteq[n]\\land\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}(S,f)\\}\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中称控制集，后续文献也称 backdoor set。这里把“容易”的含义外显为参数函数族 C_J，并使用原坐标集上的限制函数，避免把剩余坐标暗中重编号。若没有控制集，最小大小取扩展自然数 +∞；若已知每个零变量常函数属于 C_∅，全变量集合一定是控制集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^{[n]}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_J\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,1\\}^{J}}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"a\\cup b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"f_{S\\gets b}\\coloneqq\\bigl(a\\mapsto f(a\\cup b)\\bigr)\\qquad(b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{S},\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{[n]\\setminus S}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}(S,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall b\\in\\{0,1\\}^{S}\\;f_{S\\gets b}\\in\\mathcal C_{[n]\\setminus S}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\left(\\{|S|\\mid S\\subseteq[n]\\land\\mathrm{Control}_{\\mathcal C}(S,f)\\}\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1855,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-controlset|df-controlset — Control sets for Boolean zero equations]]"}],"outgoing":[]}